#21126
A dimly lit stairwell~
   You have decended a dark stairway and are in a dimly lit hallway.  Unlit
torches hang from the walls, and little light filters through from above, but is
just enough to allow you to make out a dim passage leading off to the west.  
Faint runic symbols are carved all over into the wall, and a musty smell assails
your nostrils.  As you step forward, you look down and realize you are stepping
on some type of feces.
