#21138
The burial chamber~
   You have entered the lower burial chamber of the crypt.  Recesses filled with
bones adorn the walls.  There are bas-relief surrounding the empty spaces of the
wall around the burial orifices, depicting unholy sacrifices and bizarre
religious rituals.  All covered in dust and cobwebs, an intricately decorated
stone sarcophagus lies undisturbed in the center of the room.  Just beyond the
sarcophagus, you can see a small alcove behind a crumbled wall, but you can't
seem to get past the coffin.  If only there was a way to move it...
~
